  <h1>Listing assistant</h1>
  <h2>Privacy notice</h2>

  <p>Listing assistant is a private tool operated by Denis Gubaev
  for his own eBay account. It does not accept other users.</p>

  <p>The application stores the connected eBay user ID, username
  and an encrypted refresh token in Cloudflare D1. Access tokens
  are used temporarily in memory. It does not store the eBay
  account password. Listing data, when added, is stored to
  support the owner's listing workflow.</p>

  <p>eBay and Cloudflare process data necessary for authentication,
  hosting and database services. GitHub Pages hosts this public
  privacy notice. Infrastructure logs and backups may be retained
  under each provider's settings and policies.</p>

  <p>The owner can delete locally stored account and draft data
  using the application's protected deletion control.
  Verified eBay account-deletion notifications also delete that
  user's account and draft records from the application's active
  database. Access can additionally be revoked in the eBay
  account's third-party application settings.</p>

  <p>This private tool does not sell account data.
  This version provides account connection only.</p>
